OL,3,GNEWSANew operators could take over
OL,4,Amarkets
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew operators could be brought in to
OL,7,Frun markets in parts of Cheshire.
OL,9,FCheshire East Council is to look into
OL,10,Ffinding potential new operators, or
OL,11,Ftransfer sites to town and parish
OL,12,Fcouncil control, for its markets in
OL,13,FCongleton, Crewe, Macclesfield and
OL,14,FWilmslow.
OL,16,FMick Warren, the cabinet member for
OL,17,Fplanning, housing and regeneration,
OL,18,Fsaid the authority recognised it did
OL,19,Fnot have the resources to "maximise the
OL,20,Fpotential" of the markets.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
